abstract: >-
  Website for the four-hour workshop "Kritische KI-Nutzung" (critical use of AI) offered by the
  internal continuing education group (AG IWB) of the University of Bern on 14 October 2026. The
  workshop gives an overview of current developments in generative AI and how LLMs, bots and
  agents work; participants build first prototypes for use cases from their daily work with
  commercial and local systems, including the university's GPUStack instance, and reflect on the
  limits of these systems and on strategies for responsible use.
